    old "We have to hurry. Tristain's castle and the princess are in danger.{#ch23_s_017}"
    new "Нужно спешить. Замок Тристании и принцесса в опасности."

    old "Eh… Saito-san!? Surely you're not going to the castle!?{#ch23_si_003}"
